<?svml using="@hypit/markup@1"?>
<svml>
  <import as="media" from="@hypit/media@1"/>
  <import as="text" from="@hypit/text@1"/>
  <import as="gpt" from="@hypit/gpt-image@1"/>
  <import as="seedance" from="@hypit/seedance@1"/>
  <media:Image id="brand-board" src="../../../vi/wearing-round-01/01-cuff.png"/>
  <text:Value id="image-direction">Create a single isolated full-body Wearing character, faithfully derived from the large central character in the supplied brand sheet. Preserve the exact cream softly rounded rectangular head, two small vertical dark oval eyes, no mouth, no ears or hair; small soft mitten hands and broad rounded feet. Preserve the cobalt blue soft matte woven cotton overshirt, oversized folded collar, pale blue rolled cuffs, tiny tonal buttons and two subtle patch pockets. The character is actively ROLLING UP ITS SLEEVE, exactly like the large hero character in the supplied approved brand sheet: facing the viewer with a slight three-quarter turn, one mitten hand reaches across its body to gently grasp and tug the other pale blue rolled cuff upward. Keep the hands separated and readable, one hand on the opposite cuff, never clasped together. Small grounded stance and an attentive slight head tilt: ready to help and get things done. Make the sleeve-adjusting gesture unmistakable. Its character is calm, capable and affectionate, not passive or dreamy. Tactile premium 3D animated-film illustration, soft even studio light, fine fabric texture, adult warmth. Entire character is centered in a square with generous white space, height about 76 percent of canvas. Pure uniform white background with only a very faint local contact shadow directly under feet. This is one character asset: no words, logos, UI, badges, furniture, frame, board layout, other poses or additional characters. Preserve the approved design and proportions rather than inventing a new mascot.</text:Value>
  <gpt:Image id="presence" prompt={image-direction} aspect-ratio="1:1" resolution="1K" background="opaque">
    <gpt:Reference image={brand-board}/>
  </gpt:Image>
  <text:Value id="motion-direction">A six-second seamless silent character-animation loop from this exact image. Locked camera and unchanged full-body framing, fixed pure white background and soft studio lighting. Preserve the cream rounded rectangular head, two black oval eyes with no mouth, mitten hands, cobalt woven overshirt, pale rolled cuffs, collar, feet and soft textile materials. The starting pose already has one hand on the opposite rolled sleeve cuff. The character makes one small confident upward tug of that cuff, as if saying 'I will take care of it'. It lifts its head a little to meet the viewer and gives one tiny ready-to-help nod and one soft blink. Hands stay naturally near the cuff, with subtle breathing. Settle back into the exact initial cuff-holding pose by the last second for a seamless loop. Both feet remain planted, body stays at the same position and size. One continuous uncut shot, no waving, no jumping, no zoom, no camera movement, no props, no words, no extra hands, no lip movement, no redesign or morphing. Understated personal companion who is ready to act. No sound or music.</text:Value>
  <seedance:FrameVideo id="greeting" model="mini" prompt={motion-direction} duration="6" resolution="720p" aspect-ratio="1:1" generate-audio="false" first-frame={presence.image} first-frame-person-reference="false" last-frame={presence.image} last-frame-person-reference="false"/>
</svml>
